ource":"P.10","sourceCode":"A1"},{"id":"sCD5xXzzuYxVLk5mXVGn","subjectCode":"B1","bookCode":"B1-01","qnum":"02225","type":"T1","difficulty":"◎","chapterNum":1,"sectionNum":1,"subsectionNum":1,"catalogCode":"B1-B1-01-010101","text":"國家安全威脅的根源並非僅由國內產生，而是受到區域情勢變化影響，使各國必須面對嚴重的國家安全議題。","answer":"○","analysis":"","answerCount":1,"source":"P.11","sourceCode":"A1"},{"id":"hxvf2maoyKhLyHmpq3ix","subjectCode":"B1","bookCode":"B1-01","qnum":"02226","type":"T1","difficulty":"△","chapterNum":1,"sectionNum":1,"subsectionNum":1,"catalogCode":"B1-B1-01-010101","text":"國際戰略環境逐步形成民主與極權兩個集團，並在不同區域的安全議題競爭激烈，甚至引發衝突。","answer":"○","analysis":"","answerCount":1,"source":"P.11","sourceCode":"A1"},{"id":"ULHcH73dWjSzpKHMR5xZ","subjectCode":"B1","bookCode":"B1-01","qnum":"02227","type":"T5","difficulty":"◎","chapterNum":1,"sectionNum":1,"subsectionNum":1,"catalogCode":"B1-B1-01-010101","text":"下列是國家可能面臨的安全威脅，請依類別區分並填入正確的選項\nA.外星人入侵 B.連續數年的旱（水）災 C.連續數年的饑荒 D. COVID-19流傳 E.大地震引發海嘯 F.非洲豬瘟 （  ）（1）外敵入侵。\n（  ）（2）重大天災。\n（  ）（3）大規模傳染性疾病。\n（  ）（4）糧食安全。","tail":"","answer":"（1）A （2）BE （3）DF （4）C","analysis":"","answerCount":1,"source":"P.9～10","sourceCode":"A1"},{"id":"ubSDFbNvZalbUH9gqRfS","subjectCode":"B1","bookCode":"B1-01","qnum":"02228","type":"T6","difficulty":"◎","chapterNum":1,"sectionNum":1,"subsectionNum":1,"catalogCode":"B1-B1-01-010101","text":"若以全球的觀點，人類安全的考量包含哪些？（列舉3項即可）","answer":"政治安全、人身安全、環境安全、糧食安全、衛生安全、經濟安全等。","analysis":"","answerCount":1,"source":"P.9","sourceCode":"A1"},{"id":"pxgs0Q63JbTlNPfeAV4p","subjectCode":"B1","bookCode":"B1-01","qnum":"02229","type":"T6","difficulty":"△","chapterNum":1,"sectionNum":1,"subsectionNum":1,"catalogCode":"B1-B1-01-010101","text":"非傳統安全威脅有哪些？（列舉5項即可）","answer":"族群衝突、金融危機、經濟困境、文化衝擊、恐怖主義、跨國犯罪、環境惡化、生態保育、氣候變異、資訊病毒、傳染疾病、難民危機等。","analysis":"","answerCount":1,"source":"P.9～10","sourceCode":"A1"},{"id":"NacgWd9EhHBCbm3zdzVg","subjectCode":"B1","bookCode":"B1-01","qnum":"02230","type":"T1","difficulty":"△","chapterNum":1,"sectionNum":1,"subsectionNum":2,"